  "invariants": [
    "A WorkItem is created only for (a) a rule-defined hold, (b) missing or conflicting evidence, (c) a decision requiring human authority, or (d) a provider Unknown requiring reconciliation",
    "Every WorkItem references the blocked outcome, the creating rule or event and its exit condition",
    "Assignment never confers decision authority; the decider holds authority for the action class and is not the preparer",
    "A WorkItem never expires by time alone; SLA breach escalates (FLAG-1)",
    "An AI-prepared summary is labelled and is never a decision (UNB-UI-G-011)",
    "STP rate, human touches per outcome and items per rule are measured per sponsor and workflow (UNB-RCN-PLT-006)"
